      "vposition": "none",
      "hposition": "none",
      "html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:25px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;\">Iceberg 스냅샷 커밋 vs AIStor Bucket Replication — 충돌 지점 (시간 순)</span></p>",
